# TamLy LAB

A web-based mental wellness platform designed to connect students with counselling resources and mental health professionals.

## Features

* Expert search and profiles
* Counselling appointment booking
* Personal diary and wellness quizzes
* Community forum
* Student and profile management
* Expert verification
* Activity streaks and interactive activities

## Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/jsapalebluedot/TamLy-LAB-.git
cd TamLy-LAB-
pip install -r requirement.txt
python app.py
```

## Disclaimer

This is an educational project and is not intended to provide medical diagnosis or replace professional mental health care.
